## 1. `WordCounter`

**File:** `backend/src/services/WordCounter.js`

### Relational diagram

```
WordCounter
    ▲ injected (DIP)
    │
    ├── MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy  ── counts entry.title to apply > 5 rule
    └── LessOrEqualFiveWordsStrategy ── counts entry.title to apply ≤ 5 rule
```

| Related object | Relationship |
|---|---|
| `MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy` | Receives a `WordCounter` instance; uses `count()` inside `apply()`. |
| `LessOrEqualFiveWordsStrategy` | Same injection pattern; different threshold and sort field. |
| Worker `createServices()` | Creates one shared `WordCounter` and injects it into both strategies. |

### Description & characteristics

Pure domain service that counts words in a title. Splits on whitespace, ignores isolated symbols/punctuation. Stateless, deterministic, no I/O — easy to unit test.

### Variables

| Name | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `WORD_SEPARATOR` | `RegExp` (module) | `/\s+/` — split on any whitespace run. |
| `ISOLATED_SYMBOL` | `RegExp` (module) | `/^[^\p{L}\p{N}]+$/u` — token with no letters/digits. |

### Constructor

Default (no explicit constructor). Instantiated as `new WordCounter()`.

### Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| `count(title)` | Returns `0` for non-string/empty input; otherwise trims, splits by `WORD_SEPARATOR`, filters out isolated symbols, returns token count. |

### Related objects list

- `MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy`
- `LessOrEqualFiveWordsStrategy`
- `createServices` (worker.js)

