## 2. `FilterStrategy` (abstract base)

**File:** `backend/src/services/strategies/FilterStrategy.js`

### Relational diagram

```
FilterStrategy (base / contract)
    ▲ extends
    │
    ├── MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy
    └── LessOrEqualFiveWordsStrategy
              ▲ used via
              │
         handleEntriesQuery (worker)  ── strategy.apply(entries)
```

| Related object | Relationship |
|---|---|
| Concrete strategies | Inherit and override `apply()` (OCP + LSP). |
| `handleEntriesQuery` | Looks up strategy by filter id; only depends on the base contract (DIP). |

### Description & characteristics

Abstract filter contract: identifies a filter by `name` and requires subclasses to implement `apply(entries)`. Enables the Strategy pattern.

