## 3. `MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy`

**File:** `backend/src/services/strategies/MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy.js`

### Relational diagram

```
FilterStrategy
      ▲ extends
MoreThanFiveWordsStrategy
      │ uses
WordCounter.count(title)
      │ filters/sorts
Entry[] ──► results (comments desc)
