| `MIN_WORD_COUNT` | `number` (const) | `5` — threshold for `>`. |
| `this.name` | `string` | `'MORE_THAN_5_WORDS_BY_COMMENTS'`. |
| `this.wordCounter` | `WordCounter` | Injected counter. |

### Constructor

| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `wordCounter` | `WordCounter` | Passed to logic; `super('MORE_THAN_5_WORDS_BY_COMMENTS')`. |

### Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| `apply(entries)` | Filters titles with `count > 5`, sorts by `comments` descending, returns new array. |

