| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `projectId` | `string` | from `firebaseConfig` | Required. |
| `apiKey` | `string` | from `firebaseConfig` | Required. |
| `fetcher` | `function` | `globalThis.fetch` | Injectable transport. |

### Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| `#request(method, path, body)` (private) | Low-level REST call; maps 404 → `{ notFound: true }`; throws on other errors. |
