| `saveEntries(entries)` | Validates array; `PATCH` `entries_cache/latest`; returns `'latest'`. |
| `getSystemConfig()` | `GET` config doc; 404 → defaults; else decode + merge. |
| `updateSystemConfig(config)` | Validates; merges with defaults; `PATCH` full encoded doc; returns merged object. |

Module helpers: `encodeValue`, `encodeFields`, `decodeValue`, `decodeFields`, `documentIdFromName`.

