## 11. `App` (root component)

**File:** `frontend/src/App.jsx`

### Relational diagram

```
App
 ├── TopBar ── onOpenLogs / onOpenSchedule / logCount / mode
 ├── FilterControls ── selectedFilter, onRun, onScrape
 ├── ResultsTable ── displayedResults, meta, source
 ├── Modal(logs) ── AuditLogsTable (logs, logsError)
 └── Modal(schedule) ── ScheduleConfig + footer Save
         │
         ├── api.js (fetchEntries, scrapeNow, get/updateSystemConfig)
         └── firebase.js (subscribeUsageLogs, subscribeEntriesCache)
```

| Related object | Relationship |
|---|---|
| `TopBar`, `Modal`, panels | Composition / layout ownership. |
| `api.js` | Manual HTTP actions (filters, scrape, config). |
| `firebase.js` | Realtime subscriptions for cache + audit logs. |

### Description & characteristics

Owns all application state and wiring. Single-screen UX: Results is primary; Logs and Execution open as modals from the top menu.

### Variables (state)

| State | Initial | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `selectedFilter` | `'NO_FILTER'` | Active chip. |
| `cachedEntries` | `[]` | Realtime `entries_cache`. |
| `results` | `null` | Last API filter response (`null` = show cache). |
| `meta` | `null` | Filter/run metadata for Results header. |
| `logs`, `logsError` | `[]`, `null` | Realtime audit list. |
| `config`, `mode`, `frequencyHours` | config-driven | Execution settings form. |
| `loading`, `saving` | `false` | Button busy states. |
| `notice`, `error` | `null` | User feedback banners. |
| `openPanel` | `null` | `'logs'` \| `'schedule'` \| closed. |

Derived: `displayedResults = results ?? cachedEntries`; `resultsSource`.

### Constructor / mount

React function component; two `useEffect`s: (1) Firestore subscriptions with cleanup, (2) load system config once.

### Methods (handlers)

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| `runFilter()` | `fetchEntries(selectedFilter)` → set results/meta/notice. |
| `runScrape()` | `scrapeNow()` → clear API results (back to cache) + notice. |
| `saveConfig()` | PUT cron settings; closes schedule modal on success. |
| `handleFrequencyChange(hours)` | Updates select + preview `cron_expression`. |
| `handleModeChange(mode)` | Toggles manual/scheduled + `cron_enabled`. |
| `handleSelectFilter(id)` | Sets chip; `NO_FILTER` clears API results → cache view. |

### Related objects list

