# Cross-cutting data shapes

## Entry (plain object — not a class)

```js
{ number: number, title: string, points: number, comments: number }
```

Produced by `HackerNewsScraper.parse`, consumed by strategies, Worker responses, `entries_cache`, and `ResultsTable`.

## Usage log (plain object)

```js
{
  timestamp: string,        // ISO 8601
  filter_applied: string,   // filter id or scrape reason
  results_count: number,
  execution_type: 'MANUAL' | 'SCHEDULED',
  execution_time_ms: number
}
```

Written by repositories; read realtime by `subscribeUsageLogs` → `AuditLogsTable`.

## System config (plain object)

```js
{ cron_enabled: boolean, cron_expression: string }
```

Read/updated via `/api/config` and `ScheduleConfig`.

